# 6. Advertising

PregnaCare may display advertisements through third-party advertising partners, including Google AdMob.

Advertising partners may collect:

* Advertising identifiers
* Device information
* App interaction data

This information may be used to provide personalized or non-personalized advertisements, subject to applicable laws and user consent requirements.

Users who subscribe to premium plans may experience reduced or no advertising.

