# 7. Analytics

We may use analytics services including:

* Firebase Analytics
* Firebase Crashlytics

These services help us understand:

* Feature usage
* Performance issues
* Crash reports
* User engagement

Analytics data is generally aggregated and does not directly identify individual users.

